{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "262c77e8-16c7-406b-a339-e34c8f8554f1",
    "name": "FastAPI Clean Architecture and DDD Template",
    "description": "Python FastAPI backend template, organized by Clean Architecture layers (domain, application, infrastructure, presentation) and DDD principles. Includes dependency management, Docker support, testing boilerplate, CI-friendly setup and best practices, modular scaffolding to jump-start new projects and ensure long-term maintainability.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Authentication",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"login retorna 200\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"cookies de sessao emitidos\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.cookies.has(\"access_token\"), \"access_token\").to.be.true;",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.cookies.has(\"refresh_token\"), \"refresh_token\").to.be.true;",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "packages": {},
                "requests": {}
              },
              "listen": "test"
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                {
                  "value": "password",
                  "description": "Obrigatorio pelo OAuth2PasswordRequestFormStrict. Sem ele a resposta e 422.",
                  "type": "text",
                  "key": "grant_type"
                },
                {
                  "value": "{{admin_email}}",
                  "description": "Email do usuario, vindo das variaveis da colecao.",
                  "type": "text",
                  "key": "username"
                },
                {
                  "value": "{{admin_password}}",
                  "description": "Senha do usuario, vinda das variaveis da colecao.",
                  "type": "text",
                  "key": "password"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/authentication/login/",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "authentication",
                "login",
                ""
              ]
            },
            "description": "Autentica o usuario e emite os cookies de sessao.\n\n**Tier:** publico\n\nO corpo e `x-www-form-urlencoded` porque o endpoint usa `OAuth2PasswordRequestFormStrict`, que **exige** o campo `grant_type=password`. Enviar apenas username/password retorna 422.\n\nApos o 200, o Postman guarda os cookies `access_token`, `refresh_token` e `device_id` automaticamente e todas as demais requisicoes passam a funcionar."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh Token",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/authentication/refresh/",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "authentication",
                "refresh",
                ""
              ]
            },
            "description": "Rotaciona o access token usando o cookie `refresh_token`.\n\n**Tier:** user\n\nNao recebe corpo. O access token antigo para de valer imediatamente apos esta chamada, tanto no Postgres quanto no cache Redis."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/authentication/logout/",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "authentication",
                "logout",
                ""
              ]
            },
            "description": "Revoga a sessao e limpa os cookies.\n\n**Tier:** publico na allowlist, mas exige sessao valida (`authenticate_logout`).\n\nApos esta chamada o access token retorna 401 mesmo dentro da validade."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "Login, renovacao de token e logout. A sessao e materializada como cookies HttpOnly."
    },
    {
