    {
      "name": "Key",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create API Key",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"CI pipeline\",\n  \"description\": \"Used by the CI pipeline to publish releases.\",\n  \"expires_in\": \"30_days\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/key/",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "key",
                ""
              ]
            },
            "description": "Cria uma API Key e retorna o segredo em claro **uma unica vez**.\n\n**Tier:** admin\n\nO banco guarda apenas o hash HMAC-SHA256. Se voce perder o valor retornado aqui, a unica saida e rotacionar ou criar outra.\n\n`expires_in` aceita: `7_days`, `30_days`, `45_days`, `60_days`, `90_days`, `6_months`, `never`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get All API Keys",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"retorna 200\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "const items = pm.response.json()?.details?.data?.api_keys ?? [];",
                  "if (items.length > 0) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"key_id\", items[0].id);",
                  "    console.log(\"key_id =\", items[0].id);",
                  "} else {",
                  "    console.warn(\"Nenhuma API Key ativa. Rode o Create API Key antes.\");",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/key/?page=1&limit=10&sort_by=updated_at&sort_order=desc",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "key",
                ""
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "page",
                  "value": "1"
                },
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "10"
                },
                {
                  "key": "sort_by",
                  "value": "updated_at",
                  "description": "Aceita: name, created_at, updated_at. Default: created_at."
                },
                {
                  "key": "sort_order",
                  "value": "desc"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Lista paginada de API Keys ativas.\n\n**Tier:** admin\n\nO teste desta requisicao salva o id do primeiro item em `{{key_id}}`, usado pelas requisicoes de detalhe, update, rotate e delete."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get API Key by Id",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/key/{{key_id}}/",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "key",
                "{{key_id}}",
                ""
              ]
            },
            "description": "Detalhe de uma API Key.\n\n**Tier:** admin\n\nRode **Get All API Keys** antes para popular `{{key_id}}`. Os campos `created_by` e `updated_by` retornam email e preferred name, nao o UUID. O segredo nunca e retornado: apenas `prefix` e `last_four` para exibicao mascarada."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Update API Key",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"CI pipeline renomeada\",\n  \"description\": \"Nova descricao da chave.\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/key/{{key_id}}/",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "key",
                "{{key_id}}",
                ""
              ]
            },
            "description": "Atualiza nome e/ou descricao da API Key.\n\n**Tier:** admin\n\nEnviar valores identicos aos ja gravados retorna **400 (nada mudou)**, nao 200. Ambos os campos sao opcionais, mas ao menos um deve vir no corpo; `description: null` limpa a descricao."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Rotate API Key",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/key/{{key_id}}/rotate/",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "key",
                "{{key_id}}",
                "rotate",
                ""
              ]
            },
            "description": "Gera um segredo novo para a chave, revogando o anterior **na hora e sem periodo de graca**.\n\n**Tier:** admin\n\nNao recebe corpo. Retorna o novo segredo uma unica vez. Qualquer cliente ainda usando o segredo antigo passa a receber 401 assim que esta chamada completa, entao coordene o rollout antes de rotacionar."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete API Key",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/key/{{key_id}}/",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "key",
                "{{key_id}}",
                ""
              ]
            },
            "description": "Soft delete da API Key (`is_active = false`).\n\n**Tier:** admin\n\nA linha permanece no Postgres, mas a chave para de autenticar imediatamente: o cache e invalidado junto."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "API Keys. CRUD exclusivo de admin, hash HMAC-SHA256, soft delete."
    },
